This repo is used for development of the NOVA-core driver. This is a new rust driver. It is based on Dave's hacked up tree to get basic GPU support working.

I am initially tasked with developing the BIOS Firmware parser. Refer to the following directories for documentation and ongoing development:

drivers/gpu/nova-core/
drivers/gpu/nova-core/bios_diagrams/
drivers/gpu/nova-core/patches/
